    "publication_date": "2026-08-08",
    "description": "<h1>Preprint v1.0 release notes</h1>\n<p>This public research snapshot establishes the explicit lower bound</p>\n<p>[\nR_{\\mathrm{sim}}\\ge 3/2.\n]</p>\n<p>It contains the complete paper, deterministic PDF, source, and exact replay\npackage for the center--triangle construction. It also includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>the exact order-<code>N^-2</code> endpoint suppression certificate for that family;</li>\n<li>exact finite and growing refutations of the proposed normalized-product\nendpoint separator;</li>\n<li>an exact refutation of the balanced normalized arithmetic separator;</li>\n<li>proof that <code>1/3</code> is the maximal possible Bd coefficient in a universal\nconvex affine separator, together with an exact necessary coefficient\nwindow;</li>\n<li>the one-third affine theorem for every positively weighted triangle; and</li>\n<li>scoped portal and arbitrary-weight clique--pendant obstruction theorems.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The universal endpoint disjunction, every universal finite upper bound, and\nthe exact value of <code>R_sim</code> remain open. This is a public preprint and exact\ncertificate release, not a peer-reviewed journal publication or journal\nsubmission.</p>",
